{"3886600": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Batoo", "steam_appid": 3886600, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Based on a dismissed police report, <strong>BATOO </strong>is a story-driven psychological horror FPS set in the remote forests of Parbat, Nepal during 1958 BS—an era before electricity reached these isolated villages.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric First-Person Horror</strong><br><strong>Story Driven Gameplay</strong><br><strong>Psychological Horror Mechanics</strong><br><strong>Immersive Exploration</strong><br><strong>Survival Elements</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What Makes It Unique</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Authentic Cultural Setting</strong>: Experience rural Nepal in 1958 BS, capturing the isolation and superstitions of the era.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ambiguous Reality</strong>: Question whether the character's account is reliable testimony or the ravings of a traumatized mind.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Framed Narrative</strong>: The story unfolds through police documents being read in present day, adding layers of mystery.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Tension</strong>: Focus on dread and psychological horror over cheap jump scares.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Content Warning</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game contains themes of psychological distress, isolation, and disturbing imagery that may not be suitable for all players.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Based on a dismissed police report, <strong>BATOO </strong>is a story-driven psychological horror FPS set in the remote forests of Parbat, Nepal during 1958 BS—an era before electricity reached these isolated villages.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric First-Person Horror</strong><br><strong>Story Driven Gameplay</strong><br><strong>Psychological Horror Mechanics</strong><br><strong>Immersive Exploration</strong><br><strong>Survival Elements</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What Makes It Unique</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Authentic Cultural Setting</strong>: Experience rural Nepal in 1958 BS, capturing the isolation and superstitions of the era.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ambiguous Reality</strong>: Question whether the character's account is reliable testimony or the ravings of a traumatized mind.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Framed Narrative</strong>: The story unfolds through police documents being read in present day, adding layers of mystery.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Tension</strong>: Focus on dread and psychological horror over cheap jump scares.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Content Warning</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game contains themes of psychological distress, isolation, and disturbing imagery that may not be suitable for all players.</p>", "short_description": "Based on a police report dismissed, BATOO is a story-driven horror game set in 1958 BS Nepal. As per the evidence by Ved, you will uncover what really happened in the forest with his friend.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886600/8fcf3358446820d696bec1e3337140cd0ba6332c/header.jpg?t=1780298237", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886600/7806a2d403d9edd5abb36f111d6b3cd0e7ec8538/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1780298237", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.stea